    "name": "📌 Reka AI API",
    "description": "### About Reka AI\n\n\"Reka AI builds natively multimodal models (Spark, Edge, Flash, Core) for video, image, audio, and text.\"\n\nReka builds its own multimodal models and serves them through an OpenAI-compatible API. On the workspace overview it is listed under **Model makers**.\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- Postman Account\n    \n- Reka AI Account: [https://platform.reka.ai/](https://platform.reka.ai/)\n    \n\n### Usage\n\n1. Create a fork\n    \n2. Update collection variables\n    \n3. Send requests\n\nStart with the 🚀 Get Started folder.\n\nAdd your key to your **Postman Vault** as `reka_api_key` (Vault icon in the footer, then **Add secret**, using that exact name). Requests read it as `{{vault:reka_api_key}}`, so your key never leaves your device.\n\n### Documentation\n\n- API: [https://docs.reka.ai/chat/overview](https://docs.reka.ai/chat/overview)\n    \n- Models: [https://docs.reka.ai/chat/models](https://docs.reka.ai/chat/models)\n    \n",
